`Lateral movement: network share access (5140). ShareName lives on 5140, not on 4624 logons, so this search actually returns rows.`
index=wineventlog sourcetype="*WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=5140
| eval src_ip = coalesce(src_ip, IpAddress, "unknown")
| eval user = coalesce(user, SubjectUserName, "unknown")
| stats count by _time, src_ip, user, ShareName
| sort - count
